      "publication_date": "2026-01-31",
      "review_note": "Publication year is 2026 although the DOI contains 025. Tables and narrative disagree for central gamma in curved-VR; no central-gamma direction is admitted. Both Lee papers share one independence group.",
      "authors": [
        "Dong-Hyun Lee",
